This product is an unofficial, independent plugin for the DeepSeek Harness
plugin ecosystem. It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
xAI, Grok, or DeepSeek. "Grok" and "DeepSeek" are trademarks of their
respective owners.

The implementation is original work. Its understanding of the grok.com
web client's messaging behaviour was informed by the author's earlier
Web2Chat project; the DSH adapter contract and bundle packaging follow the
publicly available dsh-deepseek-web-login project (Apache-2.0). No source
code from those projects and no code extracted from any packaged
application is included in this distribution.

This software connects to grok.com using credentials supplied by the user's
own logged-in browser session. Users are responsible for complying with the
applicable terms of service and for any consequences of using their account
through this plugin.
